{
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FDFBF7\\,#F9F5E8)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#191A1A\\,#201F1A)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "{brand.y}+({brand.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#C08C00|#FFD21E",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "brand",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "21.0pt",
        "y": "11pt",
        "w": "-1",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${@i18n.b_top1}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "_note": "卡名说这个组件回答什么;源身份由左边那颗源色点承担。⚠️ 22 档英文卡名上限约 89pt(右上角时效锚从 117pt 起)。"
      },
      {
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "14pt",
        "w": "134.0pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${at}",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
      },
      {
        "id": "title",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "32pt",
        "w": "134.0pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "3",
        "lineSpacing": "3pt",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${t0},${@i18n.empty})]",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "$[if::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${t0},__none__),__none__),0,1),#0E1116|#F3F4F6,#6B7280|#8E939B)]"
      },
      {
        "id": "big",
        "type": "richText",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "{title.b}+7pt",
        "w": "134.0pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "spans": [
          {
            "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${s0},--)]",
            "fontSize": "22pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          },
          {
            "text": "${@i18n.nbsp}",
            "fontSize": "10pt"
          },
          {
            "text": "$[if::(eq::(${s0},1),${@i18n.up1},${@i18n.up})]",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
          }
        ],
        "_note": "数字与单位分两个 span,间距走 gap_span(NBSP 住在词表值里;span 边界上的普通空格两层 trim 活不下来)。"
      },
      {
        "id": "lnA",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "{big.b}+3pt",
        "w": "134.0pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${@i18n.hA}$[findNotEmpty::(${hp0},--)]${@i18n.hB}",
        "fontSize": "9.5pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
      },
      {
        "id": "lnB",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "{lnA.b}+3pt",
        "w": "134.0pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${g0},--)]",
        "fontSize": "9.5pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "_note": "普通 txt 串中间的空格没事(只剥两端),所以直接写模板空格,不用 connect::(会吃掉两侧空格)。"
      }
    ],
    "i18nEmptyOk": [
      "hA"
    ],
    "_note_i18nEmptyOk": "这些键有一半语言刻意为空:中文「14 小时前发布 · 每小时 9 分」与英文「Posted 14h ago · 9 pts/h」语序不同,同一个模板靠空串拼出两种语序;英文数字与单位紧排(`sp` 为空)。",
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "up": "赞",
        "up1": "赞",
        "hA": "占前 5 篇点赞的 ",
        "hB": "%",
        "empty": "暂无数据",
        "b_top1": "点赞最多",
        "nbsp": " "
      },
      "en-US": {
        "up": "upvotes",
        "up1": "upvote",
        "hA": "",
        "hB": "% of the top 5's upvotes",
        "empty": "No data",
        "b_top1": "Top paper",
        "nbsp": " "
      }
    },
    "_note": "生成器 tools/infosource/gen_headlines.py。"
  }
}
